Subject: [PATCH 14/23] =?UTF-8?q?BlueOS:=20Launcher3:=20chibis=200.9=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20speed,=20sounds,=20other=20pages,=20room,=20faces?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- SurfaceView at 60 % resolution, rest clip only when something changed,
  folded mouths/faces and put-away things not drawn, nothing drawn when no
  chibi is on the screen: launcher ~43 % of a core idle (was 61 %)
- single-key animation channels get a second key (Filament skips them:
  faces and idle mouths stayed from the last clip)
- chair pose on widget edges for every model, no café acts without furniture
- sounds: emotions, pick/hop/land, voice lines (blueos_chibi_sound/_talk)
- fade instead of a cut, «stay on their page», carry to another page
- each keeps her own spot on an edge (they stood inside each other)
- gift widget in the BlueOS card style
- fixes a crash at start with no chibis (sound used before it existed)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
